# GitHub Pages serves this WHOLE repo, so this file is a whitelist, not a blacklist.
# Blacklisting failed twice on 21 Aug 2026: *.bak missed a working brief left as .md,
# then !README.md missed the same brief rendered to .html plus its build script.
# Everything is ignored unless it is named below. To publish something new, add it here.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!README.md
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.webp
!*.svg
